      "fontSize": 18,
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "text": "The five named classes are actual implementations. FeastKServeBackend is their injected backend dependency.\nMCP calls the two private APIs; it does not instantiate their runtime classes in its own process.\nPSI describes input drift, not measured model-accuracy loss. Movement illustrates direction, not execution order.",
